{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里仍没底，开始重新想眼前还能承担什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"还能承担\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他已经试过，行动带来的力气并不能消掉对那种生活的牵挂。\",\n      \"key\": \"行动带来的力气\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他觉得难处不在自己不够坚定：那种生活也真能安慰他，两样他都舍不得。\",\n      \"key\": \"两样都舍不得\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"text\": \"想到自己一争取就可能硬撑，他心里疼，盼着别失去太多，可只因怕珍惜的东西受损就停下，未必留得住它们。\",\n      \"key\": \"别失去太多\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他还没想出两边都顾到的办法，也怕失去安宁，却不再要求自己先不害怕才肯动，还是先做眼前该争取的事。\",\n      \"key\": \"先做眼前该争取\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R50\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留非此即彼的逼迫松动后重新考虑能做什么，落到眼前还能承担什么，解释起头的试探。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R51\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩\",\n      \"why\": \"不重复铺陈行动带来力量，只保留行动的力量消不掉对那种生活的牵挂这一限度。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R52\", \"R53\", \"R54\", \"R55\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-4\", \"S11-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"明确难处不在自己不够坚定，而在两样都舍不得；保留那种生活确实能安慰他、两边难以无损兼顾的意思，并把安慰无法保护珍惜之物的限度落到实际代价上。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R56\", \"R57\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留争取的代价、心疼和盼着少失去些，同时说清只因怕珍惜之物受损就停下，也未必留得住它们，不再用等待无用的格言表达。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R58\", \"R59\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留害怕和没把握仍在时先做眼前该争取的事，删去重复的原则宣言，让行动落到实际选择上。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "065ba844-9370-4993-a287-ee44c78939f9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T205646518597Z", "elapsed_seconds": 596.313, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T21:06:42.845235+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4c7612266096c333a814db3af17826e17008b818f174d15f65186d2e1e467288", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4a